Changes by qarge, 2026-10-10 (version 0.2.0):

- hooks/token-weather.mjs was rewritten as hooks/token-weather.tsx:
  - the context row updates on every model request of a turn (turn.step),
    not once per turn (turn.complete);
  - new 5-hour and weekly usage limit rows, read from the endpoint /usage
    reads, with the session's own credential, and from the rate-limit
    readings Claude Code pushes during a turn (session.measure);
  - one emoji scale for all rows, progress bars, remaining capacity, the
    distance to auto-compaction, and reset countdowns;
  - fixed reading e.hasSurvey and e.bodyColumns, which live under e.props.
- hooks/hooks.json names the new module.
- .claude-plugin/plugin.json: version 0.2.0, a new description, author,
  license and homepage.
- README.md was adapted from the original's to describe this version.
- tests/token-weather.test.ts and tsconfig.json are new.
- The screenshots of version 0.1.0 were removed.

